{"reviewId": "15814735_7YiWXkO8m", "review": {"abstract": "康波资源牛市是一个累积的结果，当期供需并不是核心原因", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "\n在康波的繁荣阶段，经济基本面坚实，实体增长动力充足，股票等资产通常表现优异，而黄金等大宗商品的实际持有收益率趋于下行。然而，当康波进入衰退阶段，大宗商品价格会出现剧烈波动，这是因为经济中的不确定性增加，物价大幅波动，从而推动资源价格的上涨。这种波动特征在康波的萧条期尤为明显，黄金等资产往往表现出超额收益，与其他商品形成显著差异。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "14962-14988", "createTime": 1740754032, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "15814735_7YiWXkO8m", "userVid": 15814735, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 15814735, "name": "¹⁵⁸⁷⁴⁷⁸⁷⁹⁸⁶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaELNiapmM0YBmb2gkpoicznV9V95Pvp8icbfqzHSfWeTbQSiagOUW1ibzDJwGhYUCIveOkPicibVg1OKKR0Lc1rYFkdkoU53DHnmf7q8oumnLcTgyEzlw/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-500", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 500}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 35, "likes": [{"userVid": 340005349, "name": "鹏昊机电", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/0sDCa2E8S1vnrQVCpInMQZDgfaBpvAWcjVFAlZ5W1bvMTfNIxXNt5vYicIagNRBHzv61MRmfMYvI/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "黄金好理解 石油的滞后哪"